# Font Files Directory

Place PP Neue Montreal font files here:
- PPNeueMontreal-Regular.woff2
- PPNeueMontreal-Medium.woff2
- PPNeueMontreal-Bold.woff2

Note: PP Neue Montreal is a commercial font. You need to purchase and download it from:
https://pangrampangram.com/products/neue-montreal

Alternative: Use a fallback system font by removing the ppNeueMontreal font configuration from layout.tsx